     "size": "sm",
     "title": "Target 20°, goal 22°",
     "text": "Goal = target x (1 + MARGIN): 20.0° x 1.10 = 22.0° at 1000 and 2000us. The radio's travel sets the 20.0°; the 2.0° above are headroom for the trim."
    },
    {
     "from": 51.49,
     "to": 58.24,
     "anchor": "imu",
     "at": [
